# geode.spr: Geode Runner's sprites, CG6 (CSS=0) on a blue background.
# G green, Y yellow, B blue, R red; "." is transparent.
#
# "halo 0": masked sprites, drawing only their own pixels, so the ladders
# and bricks behind them show through.  12 rows, the height of a cell.
# Poses: r0/r1 walking right (stride, legs together), l0/l1 the same
# facing left, c0/c1 climbing, h0/h1 hand over hand on a cable, f falling.

sprite hero_r0 cg6 halo 0 bg B noerase
..GGG.
.GGGGG
..YY.Y
..YYYY
...YY.
..GGG.
.YGGGY
..GGG.
..G.G.
.G...G
G....G
......
end

